# bat (also the fzf Ctrl-T preview and delta's syntax theme source).
# "base16" uses the terminal's 16 colors, which come from the wallpaper theme,
# so bat matches Ghostty and delta; comments in palette 8 (outline) like
# Neovim's. No background.
--theme=base16
# Line numbers, git changes and the file name; no grid rules.
--style=numbers,changes,header-filename
--italic-text=always
